  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF) - - Preventive: Healthcare Customer Service &amp; Quality Management Training Project 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventative Health Managers Limited (PHM) will train a minimum of 240 youth aged 18 to 25 in healthcare administration. Successful trainees will be prepared to work as the client interface between hospitals and healthcare institutions such as health insurance companies and laboratories.</narrative>
